    "Is the profit to be maximized (i.e., maximize total weekly profit subject to it being at least 3000 yuan), or is the goal simply to find any feasible plan that meets the 3000-yuan profit floor and the other constraints?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks for a single policy choice between maximizing profit or finding any feasible plan, which constitutes one semantically independent question."
}

